  cookingInstructions:
  - Slice the pork belly.
  - Slice the pork liver.
  - Slice the green chilies.
  - Slice the garlic.
  - Slice the onion.
  - Slice the ginger.
  - Turn the stove to high heat.
  - Put the wok on the stove.
  - Add water.
  - Add the pork belly.
  - Add the pork liver.
  - Add the ginger.
  - Add the garlic
  - Add the onion
  - Put the wok lid on to simmer.
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula."
  - Add the seasoned pork blood.
  - Put the wok lid on to simmer.
  - Stir the wok.
  - Add the green chilies.
  - Add the bay leaf.
  - Put the pan lid on to simmer.
  - Add 1 tsp of vinegar.
  - Add 1 tsp of salt.
